{"analysis":"Version 9 is the best so far at 84.0. The remaining errors are mostly annotator inconsistency: neutral texts with 'tmerr' (horror), jokes about the admin labelled both ways, and positive texts with sarcastic-looking wording.

One clear fix remains. 'Ide palidhje karantina...' (pointless idea, the quarantine) is a missed negative, and its marker 'palidhje' (pointless) dropped out of the cue list in version 8. I will restore it.

To stay under 400 words, I will remove the redundant 'Condolences' from the positive not_for, since 'ngushllime' (condolences) is already a neutral cue, and drop 'numbers' from the neutral cues. Everything else stays as in version 9, to keep its balance.","question":"What sentiment does this Albanian Facebook comment on the Kosovo public health institute's COVID-19 post express: positive, neutral, or negative?","rule":"Negative needs an explicit marker: horror or despair words, fed-up complaints, insults or curses, saying the institute lies or inflates the numbers (including jokes like 'admin, stop your hand'), or angry blame of the government. A sad topic (deaths, rising cases, maskless citizens), a pointed question, a proposal or a COVID doubt without such a marker is neutral; when torn between neutral and negative, choose neutral. Positive covers praise, thanks, blessings, relief or good news about recoveries, and hopeful encouragement. Town pride and off-topic congratulations are neutral.","criteria":{"positive":{"what":"Praise, thanks, blessings, relief that cases are falling, good news about recoveries, hopeful encouraging appeals.","examples":["Asllan A Haxholli A ka lajm mat mir, 35 t'sherum (Is there better news, 35 recovered)","Shyqyr qeky nxeht e nali pak viusin se ke tu na shkatrru a (Thank God this heat has slowed the virus a bit, it was ruining us)","Perhajr edhe Juve (Blessings to you too)"],"cues":"bravo, ju lumtë (well done), faleminderit (thank you), shyqyr (thank God), lajm i mirë (good news), mir asht (it's good), t'sherum (recovered), mashallah, perhajr (congratulations/blessings)","not_for":"Sarcastic praise is negative. 'Prishtina kampion' (Prishtina champion), 'Urime libralizimi i vizav' (congratulations on visa liberalisation) and recovery forecasts are neutral."},"neutral":{"what":"Calm, playful or reasoned comments: questions, data requests, calculations, speculation, advice, proposals, criticism of citizens without insults, teasing friends about their town, jokes about delays or lab staff, tags, condolences.","examples":["Pse ka Mitrovica Verit nuk po jepni Rezultate hiq !? (Why aren't you giving any results for North Mitrovica!?)","Koka qu sot heret ai i laboratorit (The lab guy got up early today)","Askund nuk mbajne distancat, askund nuk vendosin maskat (Nowhere do they keep distance, nowhere do they wear masks)"],"cues":"hahaha, tagged names, pse (why), a ka (is there), duhet (should), hajde ma gjall (come on, livelier), kampion (champion), ngushllime (condolences)","not_for":"Comments with horror words, insults, curses, or claims of lies or inflated numbers are negative."},"negative":{"what":"Horror, despair, being fed up, insults, curses, accusing the institute of lying or inflating numbers, angry blame of the government.","examples":["15 te vdekur, tmerr. (15 dead, horror.)","kurr ska mu ba mir me ket popull budall (It'll never get better with this stupid people)","Mos rreni ma shum se kerkush sosht ka u kqyr mo kto prralla (Stop lying, nobody watches these fairy tales any more)","Hahahahahahha oo Admin Nale doren ‍♂️ (Hahaha, admin, stop your hand)"],"cues":"tmerr (horror), mjerim (misery), kjamete (catastrophe), boll keq (bad enough), na lodhet / u lodhum (worn out), na murren nqaf (you're killing us), budall / bosa (stupid / empty-headed), qija nanen (curse), rreni / rrene (lying/lies), prralla (fairy tales), dyshime (suspicions), nuk osht real (not real), nale doren (stop your hand), palidhje (pointless), deshtu (failed), e hupi kontrollen (lost control)","not_for":"Reasoned arguments, proposals, and gentle jokes about delays or lab staff are neutral."}}}
